\&[\fBno\fR\fR\&]\fBdalign\fR\fR\& 	\h'-\w' 'u' \&[Don't] align \fB\
double\fR\fRs in structures on double-precision boundaries (default \fB\
\&-Mdalign\fR\fR\&). \fB\&-Mnodalign\fR\fR\& may lead to data alignment exceptions. 
