\&-Mnoframe\fR\fR\& unless \fBvarargs\fR\fR\& is used, \fBalloca()\fR\fR\
\& is called\&,\& or the \fB\&-g\fR\fR\& switch is used). Using \fB\
\&-Mnoframe\fR\fR\& can improve execution time and decrease code, but makes it \
impossible to get a call stack traceback when using a debugger. 
.RE
